---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How MaaxGen collects, uses, and protects information, including cookies and analytics.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero--accent">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This policy explains what information MaaxGen collects on maaxgen.com, how we use it, and
        how we protect it. Review with counsel as your business requirements change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose legal-copy">
      <h2>Information we may collect</h2>
      <p>
        MaaxGen may collect information submitted through contact forms, booking forms, email, or other inquiry channels. This may include name, email address, business name, website, phone number, and message details.
      </p>
      <p>
        We may also collect device and usage data through cookies and similar technologies, such as pages viewed, approximate location derived from IP address, browser type, referral source, and interactions with site content or ads.
      </p>

      <h2>How we may use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to inquiries and schedule calls</li>
        <li>Understand the services a prospect may need</li>
        <li>Improve website content, offers, and communication</li>
        <li>Measure site performance and advertising effectiveness</li>
        <li>Maintain basic business records and follow-up notes</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>We do not sell your data</h2>
      <p>
        MaaxGen does not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for their
        marketing purposes. We use service providers only to operate the site, respond to inquiries,
        and measure performance on our behalf.
      </p>

      <h2>SMS and mobile communications</h2>
      <p>
        If you provide your phone number and opt in through our contact form, MaaxGen may send text messages related to the consent you select (marketing updates and/or non-marketing messages such as appointment confirmations, replies to your inquiry, and account or service updates). Consent to receive text messages is optional and is never a condition of submitting a form or contacting us. Message frequency may vary, and message and data rates may apply. You can reply STOP at any time to opt out, or HELP for assistance.
      </p>
      <p>
        No mobile information will be shared with third parties/affiliates for marketing/promotional purposes. Information sharing to subcontractors in support services, such as customer service is permitted. All other use case categories exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        MaaxGen uses cookies and similar technologies to improve your experience on the site,
        understand how pages perform, and measure marketing results. When you visit the site, we
        show a cookie notice explaining this practice.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Tag Manager (GTM-MF279RR2)</strong> — manages analytics and measurement tags on the site.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Analytics 4 (G-W5R65NR85B)</strong> — measures traffic and on-site behavior. Deployed through Google Tag Manager.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Meta Pixel (1528990838912009)</strong> — measures visits and conversion events for Meta advertising.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You can limit cookies through your browser settings. Blocking cookies may affect some site
        features or measurement accuracy, but you can still browse the site and submit forms.
      </p>

      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        MaaxGen uses third-party tools for forms, booking, analytics, advertising measurement, CRM, email, and website hosting. Current analytics and advertising tools are listed above. Other vendors may process inquiry data to respond to your request.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Opt in or out of SMS marketing and transactional texts on the contact form</li>
        <li>Use browser controls to block or delete cookies</li>
        <li>Contact us with privacy questions at the email below</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:support@maaxgen.com">support@maaxgen.com</a>. Confirm the preferred privacy contact email and business mailing address with counsel if needed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
